Electromagnetic sources — complete books, courses, methods and research (@em-sources: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electromagnetism) { r_6XW0N80NM6WSDWED10N8N7WX3P
Complete books and courses provide the sustained spine; precise later readings support individual physical and scholarly questions. Each source identifies the edition/version, access and known reuse conditions. Free reading, an open licence and a publicly visible catalogue are distinct. Books, articles, course media, software collections and external datasets remain external references.

**Complete introductory and technical books:** [University Physics Volume 2 — OpenStax](sources/University-Physics-Volume-2.lingua#r_5JQ0CPQ0RNJNVH175Y9V305J5Q) · [Electricity and Magnetism — MIT 8.02T and TEAL notes](sources/Electricity-and-Magnetism-MIT-8-02T.lingua#r_00CWY37VDJSBRF5D6A8BCD7SXT) · [Electromagnetics Volume 1 — Steven W. Ellingson](sources/Electromagnetics-Volume-1-Ellingson.lingua#r_30KS80JAJY91W0FGZMASQW9DJA) · [Electromagnetics Volume 2 — Steven W. Ellingson](sources/Electromagnetics-Volume-2-Ellingson.lingua#r_5P52CZD00XV6MMPFY9RHADT5KJ) · [Física III — Bernhard Johannes Lesche, UFJF](sources/Fisica-III-Lesche-UFJF.lingua#r_0A3ZH3ZNQ5PGJ4Y05BSSCBAJE7) · [Física Geral — Eletromagnetismo, UFRGS](sources/Fisica-Geral-Eletromagnetismo-UFRGS.lingua#r_1PTBDGGV7JKZBV0RD53GDFXQ8C).

