The shared [The International System of Units — BIPM and Inmetro](../../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/sources/SI-Brochure.lingua#r_0QS0FQDWGM0BE9ZM4099FGRXED) remains the unit authority; [Quantitative and technical literacy](../../../inquiry/quantitative-literacy/Quantitative-literacy.lingua#r_4XVN56PQC13JGNFPV0CSGXDCZ2), [Measurement and metrology](../../../inquiry/metrology/Metrology.lingua#r_3G54ENPA974K19AB5XF0P641N5) and [Reproducible computational work](../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ) supply the existing quantitative, measurement and reproducible-computation material. Metadata/contents inspection is not full-page verification or a claim that every linked environment still runs. Obtain a complete authorized work before relying on its method. [Reading from zero to advanced electromagnetic study](foundations/Reading-from-zero-to-advanced-fields.lingua#r_3PMR408MBJV3M39SCRZGR7S9RF) and [A complete practical and academic programme](study/A-complete-practical-and-academic-programme.lingua#r_4XEMVM6SXP5T369FTCJ14H53YX) explain what to read and do through the subject.

